{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>每逢洗完頭，長髮女生或寵物主人最怕就是舉著笨重的風筒吹足十幾分鐘，吹到手軟兼酸痛！日本家居品牌 Nitori最新推出拯救廣大懶人的「壁掛式免提風筒」，售價為 9,990 日圓（約港幣 $495 ）！這款風筒附送不傷牆面的壁掛底座，可固定在牆面或梳妝台旁，可徹底解放雙手！吹頭同時能雙手梳頭速乾、塗抹護膚品、化妝甚至滑手機追劇；幫小朋友或毛孩吹髮時更能騰出雙手，效率大大提升。機身配備立體廣角大風量馬達與負離子護髮技術，極速乾髮之餘更能撫平毛躁；加上支援上下多角度轉向調節，懶人必買家電！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179266328119795191_5200768596ad9def16b9f8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179266328292923257_17103005696ad9def344fda.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179266328515042356_15494751076ad9def5716c1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179266328699865297_400533536ad9def823c4b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17926632916674093_4523192866ad9defbda2d2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179266329331732903_13372189996ad9defdb30a2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T10:15:02.746268+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T10:01:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T10:37:45.648539+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T10:10:26.519732+00:00","content_hash":"db758e3ef713a3ddeffa5239caeaaf93cba144ccec07a86a7cd12fece2d49ee8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}